# Recommend the next best task

When you finish a task in this project, end with **one** concrete next step: `Next: <one clear
action>`, plus one or two sentences on why it matters now.

Take it from what just shipped (its unfinished seam), then from
`docs/audit/full-audit-2026-10-12.md` §7 and `docs/blueprint-v5/README.md` §13. Prefer work that
gets the pilot started over new features: the product has more surface than users.
